#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition title=\"See also\" type=\"note\">\n"
"  **Read the** [1D flow-set guide](1-d-fermi-hubbard#d-fermi-hubbard) **first.** This guide is its two-dimensional sequel and does not repeat the information developed there: transfer and vertex operators, what a flow set is, how [`groups`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/operators-transfer-vertex-operator#qiskit_fermions.operators.TransferVertexOperator.groups \"qiskit_fermions.operators.TransferVertexOperator.groups\") survives into the circuit, and how a custom encoding is wired into the transpiler through [`MapperFnEvolutionSynthesis`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/transpiler-passes-synthesis-mapper-fn-evolution-synthesis#qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.synthesis.MapperFnEvolutionSynthesis \"qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.synthesis.MapperFnEvolutionSynthesis\").\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition title=\"Viz také\" type=\"note\">\n"
"  **Nejprve si přečti** [průvodce 1D množinami toků](1-d-fermi-hubbard#d-fermi-hubbard). Tento průvodce je jeho dvourozměrným pokračováním a neopakuje informace, které tam byly rozvinuty: transferové a vertexové operátory, co je množina toků, jak [`groups`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/operators-transfer-vertex-operator#qiskit_fermions.operators.TransferVertexOperator.groups \"qiskit_fermions.operators.TransferVertexOperator.groups\") přežije do obvodu a jak se vlastní kódování zapojuje do transpilátoru přes [`MapperFnEvolutionSynthesis`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/transpiler-passes-synthesis-mapper-fn-evolution-synthesis#qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.synthesis.MapperFnEvolutionSynthesis \"qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.synthesis.MapperFnEvolutionSynthesis\").\n"

